@startuml
autonumber

actor "Customer\n(App Client)" as Customer
participant "Google Cloud\nLoad Balancing" as GCLB
participant "Chat Orchestrator\nService" as Orch
participant "User & Session\nService" as UserSvc
participant "AI Chatbot\nEngine" as AI
queue "Cloud\nPub/Sub" as PubSub
actor "Human Agent\n(Portal)" as Agent

title Runtime Sequence Flow (AI Evaluation & Escalation)

' Step 1-3: Initialization & Ingress Validation
Customer -> GCLB : HTTPS POST: Send Message Payload
activate GCLB
GCLB -> Orch : Route Ingress Request
activate Orch
deactivate GCLB

' Step 4-6: Contextual Hydration via Synced Read-Replica
Orch -> UserSvc : gRPC: Request Session & Profile Verification
activate UserSvc
note over UserSvc : Fetches replicated enterprise data\nfrom local Cloud SQL Instance
UserSvc --> Orch : Return Verified Profile Context
deactivate UserSvc

' Step 7-10: AI Feature Integration Loop
Orch -> AI : gRPC: Evaluate Message Context (GenerateResponse)
activate AI
note over AI : Queries Vertex AI Vector Search\nand computes semantic classification
AI --> Orch : Return Inference Reply + Low Confidence Score
deactivate AI

' Step 11-14: Asynchronous Escalation Pathway
note over Orch : Confidence score falls below threshold.\nTriggering human fallback policy.
Orch -> Customer : WebSocket: Push Initial Automated Acknowledgment
Orch -> PubSub : Async Publish: EscalationEvent\n(Chat History + Profile Context)
activate PubSub
PubSub --> Agent : Stream Event: Populate Assignment Queue
deactivate PubSub
activate Agent
Agent -> Customer : WebSocket Link: Active Human Takeover Confirmed
deactivate Orch
deactivate Agent

@endum
